        <mxCell id="header-sub" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1e293b&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;What happens between a ticket and an app that is ready for its first push.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Scope: one new app in an existing team (demo/timetrack). A new team adds one file, teams/&amp;lt;team&amp;gt;.yaml, and the same steps&lt;br&gt;Next: the first push to main of backend and frontend, see view release&lt;br&gt;Team file: k8s/config/app-platform/teams/&amp;lt;team&amp;gt;.yaml, one entry per app&lt;br&gt;Fork: a copy of a template project; it never follows later changes of the template&lt;br&gt;AppProject: the Argo CD fence of one app: source repos, destination namespace, allowed kinds&lt;br&gt;VSO: Vault Secrets Operator, reads Vault with the namespace&amp;#39;s Kubernetes role&lt;br&gt;v0.1 · source: k8s/config/app-platform/teams/, terraform/apps.tf, terraform/gitlab.tf, charts/platform-team, k8s/apps/app-platform-teams.yaml&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#475569;" vertex="1" parent="1">
